}

### POST advice-image
POST http://localhost:4000/consult/advice-image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Please give me some tips on how to improve my volleys.",
  "answer": "Use a compact volley motion with a stable racket face, contact the ball slightly in front of your body, and transfer your weight forward through contact. Prioritize quick split-steps, soft hands, and short wall-volley drills that reinforce balance and recovery.",
